}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\tNa studentskom si bud\u017eetu, a ipak ima\u0161 ambicije da proputuje\u0161 svijet? \u017deli\u0161 zaviriti u svaki kutak Europe? Bez brige, jer BEST ti daje priliku provesti 10 dana u nekom od 88 predivnih gradova Europe, u jednoj od 97 BEST lokalnih grupa te upoznati super zanimljive ljude! Uz to \u0107e\u0161 nau\u010diti ne\u0161to novo te se pritom odli\u010dno zabaviti! Popis seminara mo\u017ee\u0161 na\u0107i na:\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-7353edb8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7353edb8\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"aux-parallax-section elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-229a5260\" data-id=\"229a5260\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad32534 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ad32534\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"broken_link\" href=\"https:\/\/best.eu.org\/courses\/list.jsp\"><b>BEST stru\u010dni seminari<\/b><\/a>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3edf2c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3edf2c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOvi seminari su sve samo ne dosadni, a jedini na\u010din da to provjeri\u0161 je da se prijavi\u0161 na jedan od njih. Svake se godine nekoliko tisu\u0107a studenata iz raznih dijelova Europe prijavljuje na BEST stru\u010dne seminare. Zanima te kako se prijaviti na seminar? Ovdje mo\u017ee\u0161 na\u0107i sve informacije koje te zanimaju.\n<br><br>\nBEST stru\u010dni seminari se odr\u017eavaju u sva \u010detiri godi\u0161nja doba \u2013 jesen, zima, prolje\u0107e i ljeto. Namijenjeni su studentima tehni\u010dkih i tehnolo\u0161kih fakulteta te traju jedan do dva tjedna, a na njima sudjeluju studenti s 97 europskih sveu\u010dili\u0161ta. Predavanja dr\u017ee sveu\u010dili\u0161ni profesori ili stru\u010dnjaci iz odre\u0111enog podru\u010dja te zbog toga na ve\u0107ini seminara mo\u017ee\u0161 dobiti ECTS bodove. Predavanja su jako zanimljiva i interaktivna te naj\u010de\u0161\u0107e ne prelaze 30 radnih sati. Svaki BEST stru\u010dni seminari ima drugu temu te mo\u017ee\u0161 izabrati ono \u0161to te najvi\u0161e zanima. Seminari su obi\u010dno vrlo jednostavni (Basic stupanj) te se svatko mo\u017ee prijaviti, bez obzira koji si fakultet. Dodatna je prednost to \u0161to mo\u017ee\u0161 birati koji seminar \u0107e\u0161 poha\u0111ati ovisno o najdra\u017eem godi\u0161njem dobu!\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f690c89 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"f690c89\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;gradient&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"aux-parallax-section elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d42df5b\" data-id=\"d42df5b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-afd5c5a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"afd5c5a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"aux-parallax-section elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-7fca680\" data-id=\"7fca680\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-183ef63 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"183ef63\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fusion-text\"><div class=\"fusion-text\"><p>Tijekom dana, osim predavanja, organizatori pripremaju razli\u010dite aktivnosti koje mogu uklju\u010divati izlete, razgledavanje grada ili razne igre, a nave\u010der se pripremi na lude provode po gradu. \u010ceka te nezaboravno iskustvo \u2013 nova prijateljstva, tona zabave i ludih partija.<\/p><p>Organizatori seminara osiguravaju ti smje\u0161taj i hranu, a cijena seminara za hrvatske studente iznosi max 40 \u20ac. Svaki seminar prima izme\u0111u 20 i 30 sudionika, a prijavljuje\u0161 se tako da po\u0161alje\u0161 motivacijsko pismo i odgovori\u0161 na 3 jednostavna pitanja. Upute za pisanje motivacijskog pisma mo\u017ee\u0161 na\u0107i na na\u0161oj stranici. Ako i dalje ima nejasno\u0107a, slobodno se javi mailom ili nas posjeti na na\u0161em redovnom sastanku \u010detvrtkom u 20:00 sati na FER-u.<\/p><p>Osim BEST stru\u010dnih seminara (BEST Courses), nudimo i in\u017eenjerska natjecanja (European BEST Engineering Competition) te simpozije s temom obrazovanja (BEST Symposia on Education). BEST Simpozij o obrazovanju je doga\u0111aj na kojem studenti, lokalni i internacionalni profesori, stru\u010dnjaci iz razli\u010ditih industrijskih i znanstvenih organizacija, predstavnici sveu\u010dili\u0161ta te kompanija raspravljaju o obrazovnom sustavu i na\u010dinima kako ga pobolj\u0161ati.<span style=\"font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight );\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p><\/div><div class=\"fusion-separator fusion-full-width-sep sep-none\">\u00a0<\/div><div class=\"fusion-button-wrapper fusion-aligncenter\"><a class=\"fusion-button button-flat button-medium button-default button-1 fusion-button-span-no fusion-button-default-type\" href=\"https:\/\/best.hr\/seminari\/faqs\/\" target=\"_self\"><span class=\"fusion-button-text\">IMA\u0160 PITANJA?<\/span><\/a><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u0160to su to BEST stru\u010dni seminari? Na studentskom si bud\u017eetu, a ipak ima\u0161 ambicije da proputuje\u0161 svijet? \u017deli\u0161 zaviriti u svaki kutak Europe? Bez brige, jer BEST ti daje priliku provesti 10 dana u nekom od 88 predivnih gradova Europe, u jednoj od 97 BEST lokalnih grupa te upoznati super zanimljive ljude! Uz to \u0107e\u0161 [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"footnotes